<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-037-A habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.17353" lon="-120.849413"><name>SC26-037-A</name><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 9.5 m relief across 210 m. Terrain A 77/100; not catch probability. Center 122 ft; nearby 119–154 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-019</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 225-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.17502523933065" lon="-120.84986786310888"/><trkpt lat="35.174921486428424" lon="-120.84910203077746"/><trkpt lat="35.175281918770786" lon="-120.84909253293104"/><trkpt lat="35.17527996909484" lon="-120.84898278878511"/><trkpt lat="35.17546018524418" lon="-120.84897803955681"/><trkpt lat="35.175386314779765" lon="-120.84841870949447"/><trkpt lat="35.17535890958718" lon="-120.84835191805999"/><trkpt lat="35.175362277447185" lon="-120.84854143721418"/><trkpt lat="35.17500184524022" lon="-120.84855093752124"/><trkpt lat="35.1749019854578" lon="-120.84800459462936"/><trkpt lat="35.175191482985866" lon="-120.84799696212761"/><trkpt lat="35.17506939152677" lon="-120.84780524138304"/><trkpt lat="35.17461989560745" lon="-120.84733024002806"/><trkpt lat="35.17388249225896" lon="-120.84698082397274"/><trkpt lat="35.17348611668901" lon="-120.84694381171705"/><trkpt lat="35.17289947550731" lon="-120.84706565619808"/><trkpt lat="35.172367135927956" lon="-120.84738964752734"/><trkpt lat="35.171934941131994" lon="-120.84788788126127"/><t